WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:40.162
[Dramatic Melancholic Piano and Swelling Orchestral Strings Intro]

00:00:40.162 --> 00:00:43.800
A thousand miles of winter gray

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:47.500
Another dawn, another day

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:51.369
The engine's hum, a weary soul

00:00:51.429 --> 00:00:55.000
A heavy price, a heavy toll

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:59.000
I see your face on frozen glass

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:03.018
A memory that's built to last

00:01:03.178 --> 00:01:06.800
